# The boundary of 5 damage. Sheoldred, the Apocalypse (black, toughness 5) takes exactly lethal damage from Essence Burn on turn 3 and is exiled instead of dying.
# Alpha Deathclaw (black and green, toughness 6) survives the same 5 damage on turn 5; "if that permanent would die this turn, exile it instead" covers
# the rest of the turn (CR 611.2c, 614.1a), so when Bot1's Lightning Bolt finishes it afterwards, it is exiled too (Bot2's graveyard stays empty).

